WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:10.685
He told me you was going with Matt Williams for a time.

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:16.960
You talk too much.

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:20.280
Oh, I don't talk too much.

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:25.970
Just thinking who I got to beat in this horse race, that's all.

00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:27.490
I didn't realize this was a race.

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:32.700
I don't care for watching horses.

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:35.325
Well, I'm a different kind of horse.

00:00:38.604 --> 00:00:40.214
 

00:00:40.214 --> 00:00:41.040
Hmm?

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:44.040
 

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:45.670
What was that?

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:49.467
 That's how you are.

00:00:49.467 --> 00:00:51.300
I don't know what you said, but it must have

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:53.950
been Indian for handsome devil.

00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:54.550
[LAUGHTER]

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:58.200
[LAUGHTER]

